### Draya API Test Suite
### Base URL Configuration
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7052
@baseUrlHttp = http://localhost:5286

### Variables for storing tokens and IDs
@accessToken = 
@refreshToken = 
@teacherId = 
@studentId = 

###############################################################################
### AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS - Teacher Registration and Login
###############################################################################

### 1. Register a Teacher
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/teacher
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher1@example.com",
  "password": "Teacher@123456",
  "fullName": "John Doe Teacher",
  "phone": "+201234567890"
}

### Expected: 201 Created with userId and tokens
### Save the tokens from response for subsequent requests

###

### 2. Register another Teacher for testing
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/teacher
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher2@example.com",
  "password": "Teacher@123456",
  "fullName": "Jane Smith Teacher",
  "phone": "+201234567891"
}

###

### 3. Register a Student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student1@example.com",
  "password": "Student@123456",
  "fullName": "Alice Johnson Student",
  "parentGuardianEmail": "parent1@example.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "2010-05-15"
}

### Expected: 201 Created with userId and tokens

###

### 4. Register another Student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student2@example.com",
  "password": "Student@123456",
  "fullName": "Bob Williams Student",
  "parentGuardianEmail": "parent2@example.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "2011-08-22"
}

###

### 5. Login as Teacher
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher1@example.com",
  "password": "Teacher@123456"
}

### Expected: 200 OK with accessToken and refreshToken
### IMPORTANT: Copy the accessToken value and paste it in the @accessToken variable above

###

### 6. Login as Student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student1@example.com",
  "password": "Student@123456"
}

###

### 7. Test Invalid Login (Wrong Password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher1@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123"
}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

###

### 8. Test Invalid Login (Non-existent Email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
  "password": "SomePassword123"
}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

###

###############################################################################
### AUTHENTICATED ENDPOINTS - Requires Bearer Token
###############################################################################

### 9. Get My Profile (Teacher)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Expected: 200 OK with teacher profile data
### Replace {{accessToken}} with actual token from login response

###

### 10. Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Expected: 200 OK with new accessToken and refreshToken
### Replace {{refreshToken}} with actual refresh token from login response

###

### 11. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Expected: 204 No Content

###

###############################################################################
### PASSWORD RESET FLOW
###############################################################################

### 12. Request Password Reset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher1@example.com"
}

### Expected: 200 OK with message
### Note: In development, the reset token would be logged or emailed

###

### 13. Confirm Password Reset (requires token from email/logs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_RESET_TOKEN_HERE",
  "newPassword": "NewTeacher@123456"
}

### Expected: 204 No Content

###

###############################################################################
### SUBSCRIPTION ENDPOINTS - Teacher Only
###############################################################################

### 14. Get Current Subscription (Teacher must be logged in)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscription/current
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Expected: 200 OK with subscription details
### Note: This requires a teacher token and an active subscription

###

### 15. Get Subscription Usage (Teacher must be logged in)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscription/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Expected: 200 OK with usage statistics

###

###############################################################################
### NEGATIVE TEST CASES
###############################################################################

### 16. Try to access subscription endpoint without authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscription/current

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

###

### 17. Try to access subscription endpoint with student credentials
# First login as student to get student token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student1@example.com",
  "password": "Student@123456"
}

### Then use student token to access teacher-only endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscription/current
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE

### Expected: 403 Forbidden (role-based access denied)

###

### 18. Test duplicate email registration (Teacher)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/teacher
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher1@example.com",
  "password": "Teacher@123456",
  "fullName": "Duplicate Teacher",
  "phone": "+201234567899"
}

### Expected: 409 Conflict

###

### 19. Test duplicate email registration (Student)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student1@example.com",
  "password": "Student@123456",
  "fullName": "Duplicate Student",
  "parentGuardianEmail": "parent3@example.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "2012-03-10"
}

### Expected: 409 Conflict

###

### 20. Test invalid email format
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/teacher
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid-email-format",
  "password": "Teacher@123456",
  "fullName": "Invalid Email Teacher",
  "phone": "+201234567892"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request

###

### 21. Test weak password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/teacher
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "weakpass@example.com",
  "password": "weak",
  "fullName": "Weak Password Teacher",
  "phone": "+201234567893"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request

###

###############################################################################
### UTILITY ENDPOINTS
###############################################################################

### 22. Health Check (if available)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

### 23. Swagger Documentation
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/index.html

###
